> References

- [Gidaris et al. (2018), Unsupervised Representation Learning by Predicting Image Rotations](https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.07728).
- [Noroozi and Favaro (2016), Unsupervised Learning of Visual Representations by Solving Jigsaw Puzzles](https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.09246).
- [Doersch et al. (2015), Unsupervised Visual Representation Learning by Context Prediction](https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.05192).
